1
00:00:08,980 --> 00:00:13,780
(This story is entirely fictional)

2
00:00:16,280 --> 00:00:18,120
You messed up on the last big question.

3
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:20,280
You did it on purpose, right?

4
00:00:27,680 --> 00:00:29,120
If you hadn't done it on purpose,

5
00:00:29,960 --> 00:00:31,440
(Based on Doctor Qin: Executer)
our scores would've tied.

6
00:00:31,720 --> 00:00:32,360
We still could've gotten

7
00:00:32,360 --> 00:00:34,000
into the same university.

8
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:36,400
But...

9
00:00:37,520 --> 00:00:38,360
But what?

10
00:00:38,520 --> 00:00:39,680
But you lost this time.

11
00:00:39,680 --> 00:00:40,880
You owe me a soda.

12
00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:44,400
Let's go.

13
00:00:45,240 --> 00:00:46,040
Wait.

14
00:00:49,280 --> 00:00:50,080
Come back.

15
00:00:53,560 --> 00:00:54,360
Closer.

16
00:01:21,700 --> 00:01:23,860
(Setting Off Fireworks)

17
00:01:29,480 --> 00:01:30,280
Qin.

18
00:01:31,160 --> 00:01:33,080
Jin Keke definitely
isn't coming tonight.

19
00:01:34,920 --> 00:01:35,680
Set them off.

20
00:02:10,560 --> 00:02:11,360
(Qin Ming.)

21
00:02:13,200 --> 00:02:14,520
(It's your turn to solve it.)

22
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:16,640
(Solve it now.)

23
00:02:24,120 --> 00:02:24,920
(Qin Ming.)

24
00:02:37,700 --> 00:02:41,700
=Doctor Qin: Executer=
=Episode 8=

25
00:02:41,700 --> 00:02:44,360
(Weiyou Mart)

26
00:02:47,560 --> 00:02:48,480
Welcome.

27
00:03:10,600 --> 00:03:11,400
Three yuan.

28
00:03:14,240 --> 00:03:15,000
What?

29
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:16,800
You clearly came looking for me.

30
00:03:17,040 --> 00:03:18,160
Why make that face?

31
00:03:18,760 --> 00:03:20,520
You know I work here.

32
00:03:20,680 --> 00:03:21,920
Are you always on night shifts?

33
00:03:24,120 --> 00:03:25,400
The schedule's right there.

34
00:03:25,840 --> 00:03:27,320
If you've got questions,
look for yourself.

35
00:03:30,600 --> 00:03:31,480
Before, you said

36
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:34,520
you've been having the same dream
for ten years,

37
00:03:35,480 --> 00:03:36,920
and you'd tell me when we met again.

38
00:03:37,920 --> 00:03:38,720
Sorry.

39
00:03:38,880 --> 00:03:40,200
I don't wanna answer that right now.

40
00:03:42,960 --> 00:03:43,920
Then can you tell me

41
00:03:44,600 --> 00:03:46,000
why you never replied

42
00:03:47,560 --> 00:03:48,720
to that last letter ten years ago?

43
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:49,800
A reply?

44
00:03:51,160 --> 00:03:52,360
From the day I dropped out,

45
00:03:52,440 --> 00:03:54,200
my life was already over.

46
00:03:55,240 --> 00:03:56,320
You probably don't know

47
00:03:56,680 --> 00:03:58,760
how hard it is for a girl to survive.

48
00:03:58,840 --> 00:04:00,080
Sometimes, I think

49
00:04:00,680 --> 00:04:02,080
being dead would've been fine.

50
00:04:02,640 --> 00:04:04,120
But I survived.

51
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:06,160
If I hadn't dropped out,

52
00:04:07,240 --> 00:04:09,120
if I had stayed in school with you,

53
00:04:09,600 --> 00:04:10,960
taken the Gaokao with you,

54
00:04:11,480 --> 00:04:12,680
and gone to university with you,

55
00:04:14,120 --> 00:04:14,920
maybe

56
00:04:16,280 --> 00:04:18,200
I could've had the life I wanted.

57
00:04:18,680 --> 00:04:19,920
But there's no "if."

58
00:04:21,200 --> 00:04:22,760
About why Xia Wen ended up like that,

59
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:24,760
I've been thinking for ten years.

60
00:04:25,680 --> 00:04:26,480
You said

61
00:04:27,280 --> 00:04:28,520
I always leave without saying goodbye.

62
00:04:29,080 --> 00:04:29,880
Maybe

63
00:04:29,880 --> 00:04:31,560
I just didn't have the strength
to say goodbye.

64
00:04:32,840 --> 00:04:33,640
Sorry.

65
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:36,760
I didn't come here
to pick at your scars.

66
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:41,320
But lately, there've been some clues
at crime scenes

67
00:04:41,800 --> 00:04:43,360
that remind me of our past.

68
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:45,480
If my showing up disturbed you,

69
00:04:45,960 --> 00:04:46,880
I'm sorry.

70
00:04:49,400 --> 00:04:50,200
Qin Ming.

71
00:04:51,360 --> 00:04:53,200
Trust your eyes and your feelings.

72
00:04:53,560 --> 00:04:55,560
Just don't trust the story
anyone tells you.

73
00:04:58,200 --> 00:04:58,960
A pack of cigarettes.

74
00:04:58,960 --> 00:05:00,400
Hello, welcome.

75
00:05:05,320 --> 00:05:06,080
Thirteen yuan.

76
00:05:06,720 --> 00:05:07,520
Okay.

77
00:05:09,160 --> 00:05:10,280
Welcome back anytime.

78
00:05:14,800 --> 00:05:15,680
I'm leaving.

79
00:05:17,400 --> 00:05:18,880
Actually, in a way,

80
00:05:19,600 --> 00:05:21,360
Xia Wen's death gave me a mom.

81
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:24,520
So the pain isn't as sharp.

82
00:05:29,980 --> 00:05:32,980
(Weiyou Mart)

83
00:05:52,480 --> 00:05:54,600
(Lime Juice)

84
00:05:54,600 --> 00:06:00,240
(Lime Juice)

85
00:06:08,540 --> 00:06:11,560
(Wang Capital Management Co., Ltd.
Old City Redevelopment)

86
00:06:11,560 --> 00:06:12,400
He Guifen.

87
00:06:14,800 --> 00:06:15,680
Your turn.

88
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:34,800
Mr. Qin.

89
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:38,800
Mr. Qin?

90
00:06:40,800 --> 00:06:41,320
Qin Ming!

91
00:06:43,240 --> 00:06:44,720
You're spacing out again?

92
00:06:44,840 --> 00:06:45,880
Just get to the point.

93
00:06:45,880 --> 00:06:48,000
Han Liang found info on Xu Meng.

94
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:48,640
She

95
00:06:48,640 --> 00:06:50,600
left Longfan half a year ago.

96
00:06:50,680 --> 00:06:51,880
But she has a stepmother

97
00:06:52,080 --> 00:06:53,560
living in Jiuyuan Apartments

98
00:06:53,600 --> 00:06:55,200
named He Guifen.

99
00:06:55,520 --> 00:06:57,600
Have you found anything else
on He Guifen?

100
00:06:57,600 --> 00:06:58,520
Not yet.

101
00:06:58,680 --> 00:06:59,560
I heard some things while doing

102
00:06:59,560 --> 00:07:00,720
door-to-door visits.

103
00:07:01,280 --> 00:07:02,360
An old neighbor said

104
00:07:02,480 --> 00:07:03,960
Xu Meng's mom died young.

105
00:07:04,040 --> 00:07:05,680
Her dad died a few years

106
00:07:05,680 --> 00:07:07,000
after marrying He Guifen.

107
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:09,320
He Guifen didn't kick Xu Meng out,

108
00:07:09,480 --> 00:07:12,160
but she didn't treat
her stepdaughter well.

109
00:07:12,240 --> 00:07:13,280
That's easy to imagine.

110
00:07:14,080 --> 00:07:14,760
Keep digging.

111
00:07:15,360 --> 00:07:16,360
Mainly check

112
00:07:16,360 --> 00:07:18,160
whether He Guifen got connected
to Zhang Xiaodong

113
00:07:18,160 --> 00:07:19,160
because of Xu Meng.

114
00:07:19,160 --> 00:07:20,960
Also, keep looking for Xu Meng.

115
00:07:20,960 --> 00:07:21,760
Got it.

116
00:07:22,680 --> 00:07:23,520
He Guifen!

117
00:07:24,520 --> 00:07:25,320
He Guifen.

118
00:07:35,520 --> 00:07:36,320
Liang.

119
00:07:36,440 --> 00:07:38,280
There's a foul-smelling liquid
leaking out.

120
00:07:38,280 --> 00:07:39,560
Notify the tech team
and the forensic examiner.

121
00:07:39,600 --> 00:07:40,400
Get ready to break the door.

122
00:07:40,400 --> 00:07:40,760
Got it.

123
00:07:40,760 --> 00:07:41,520
Got it.

124
00:07:48,440 --> 00:07:49,520
Livor mortis is fixed.

125
00:07:49,520 --> 00:07:50,360
Doesn't fade under pressure.

126
00:07:50,720 --> 00:07:52,320
Rigor mortis is easing
from the large joints.

127
00:07:52,320 --> 00:07:53,880
Time of death is around
seventy-two hours ago.

128
00:07:54,880 --> 00:07:56,240
Fibers under her nails.

129
00:07:56,360 --> 00:07:58,080
The skin loss doesn't look severe.

130
00:07:58,120 --> 00:08:00,720
Probably from scratching herself.

131
00:08:06,320 --> 00:08:07,320
Blood spots in the whites of her eyes.

132
00:08:08,200 --> 00:08:09,160
Purple lips.

133
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:34,800
Hello?

134
00:08:35,880 --> 00:08:36,920
Are you Xu Meng?

135
00:08:36,920 --> 00:08:37,680
You're lying!

136
00:08:37,680 --> 00:08:38,760
What do you want?

137
00:08:38,760 --> 00:08:39,840
You liar!

138
00:08:39,920 --> 00:08:40,760
Give me back my money!

139
00:08:41,480 --> 00:08:43,360
Yeah, I'm calling the police.

140
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:46,240
I'm gonna have the cops arrest you!

141
00:09:03,280 --> 00:09:04,080
Hypoxia?

142
00:09:04,240 --> 00:09:05,200
Sudden heart attack?

143
00:09:05,560 --> 00:09:06,840
Look at the scratch marks on her chest.

144
00:09:06,840 --> 00:09:08,760
She must've been in terrible heart pain

145
00:09:08,920 --> 00:09:10,120
to scratch herself that hard.

146
00:09:10,240 --> 00:09:12,560
No sign anyone else came in.

147
00:09:12,920 --> 00:09:14,440
The lock's fine too.

148
00:09:14,880 --> 00:09:16,800
Between how she looks

149
00:09:16,880 --> 00:09:18,920
and all these torn-up papers,

150
00:09:19,040 --> 00:09:20,160
she must've found out something

151
00:09:20,160 --> 00:09:21,520
she couldn't handle

152
00:09:21,840 --> 00:09:23,120
and got so worked up

153
00:09:23,600 --> 00:09:24,960
she couldn't breathe.

154
00:09:26,360 --> 00:09:28,000
Found a torn-up contract.

155
00:09:32,280 --> 00:09:33,280
(Jia Xibei)
The seal's fake.

156
00:09:33,280 --> 00:09:34,360
She got scammed?

157
00:09:34,760 --> 00:09:35,720
No wonder she died of anger.

158
00:09:35,720 --> 00:09:37,720
We can only make a preliminary judgment
at the scene.

159
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:39,800
We'll have to wait for the autopsy

160
00:09:39,800 --> 00:09:41,480
to rule out drugs.

161
00:09:41,480 --> 00:09:42,600
Now Xu Meng's missing,

162
00:09:42,600 --> 00:09:43,640
and He Guifen's dead.

163
00:09:44,040 --> 00:09:46,000
These two things
are very likely connected.

164
00:09:50,920 --> 00:09:52,760
Go check He Guifen's social circle.

165
00:09:53,200 --> 00:09:53,920
What's going on here?

166
00:09:53,920 --> 00:09:55,360
I heard He Guifen's dead.

167
00:09:55,360 --> 00:09:56,120
He Guifen?

168
00:09:56,760 --> 00:09:57,760
You know He Guifen?

169
00:09:58,800 --> 00:10:00,160
No, I don't.

170
00:10:00,360 --> 00:10:01,160
(No Entry; Police)
After him!

171
00:10:07,800 --> 00:10:08,600
Stop running!

172
00:10:10,120 --> 00:10:10,920
Stop!

173
00:10:17,680 --> 00:10:18,200
Stop running!

174
00:10:29,480 --> 00:10:30,320
Over there! After him!

175
00:10:47,240 --> 00:10:48,240
It's flying.

176
00:10:55,480 --> 00:10:56,720
This place is so winding.

177
00:11:04,240 --> 00:11:05,040
Here!

178
00:11:07,880 --> 00:11:08,400
Turn around!

179
00:11:16,680 --> 00:11:17,560
You're really a runner.

180
00:11:21,400 --> 00:11:22,200
Go.

181
00:11:25,760 --> 00:11:26,560
Move!

182
00:11:28,320 --> 00:11:30,600
I think it's this way.

183
00:11:31,240 --> 00:11:32,040
- Move!
- Go.

184
00:11:37,560 --> 00:11:38,360
Liang.

185
00:11:41,920 --> 00:11:43,080
This is the investment contract

186
00:11:43,080 --> 00:11:44,720
He Guifen was holding when she died.

187
00:11:44,920 --> 00:11:45,920
The contract's fake.

188
00:11:45,920 --> 00:11:46,680
And

189
00:11:46,840 --> 00:11:48,760
for this fake contract investment,

190
00:11:48,760 --> 00:11:50,760
He Guifen mortgaged her house.

191
00:11:52,600 --> 00:11:53,840
She got scammed out

192
00:11:53,920 --> 00:11:55,360
of her entire life savings.

193
00:11:55,840 --> 00:11:56,960
No wonder she was so angry.

194
00:11:57,920 --> 00:11:58,920
We need to have a good talk

195
00:11:58,920 --> 00:12:00,720
with the sprinter, Jia Xibei.

196
00:12:02,920 --> 00:12:04,320
You're the contract guarantor?

197
00:12:07,200 --> 00:12:08,240
Officer,

198
00:12:08,880 --> 00:12:10,160
I'm a victim too.

199
00:12:10,760 --> 00:12:12,720
Guifen and I both got scammed.

200
00:12:12,720 --> 00:12:14,360
When I found out I'd been scammed,

201
00:12:14,360 --> 00:12:16,240
I wanted to hurry and tell Guifen.

202
00:12:16,880 --> 00:12:17,680
But then...

203
00:12:19,880 --> 00:12:21,520
Who's Li Mei on this contract?

204
00:12:21,600 --> 00:12:22,640
Oh, Ms. Li.

205
00:12:23,760 --> 00:12:24,920
She's my upline.

206
00:12:25,400 --> 00:12:27,320
She took the money and disappeared.

207
00:12:27,320 --> 00:12:29,200
I can't reach her no matter what.

208
00:12:29,360 --> 00:12:31,120
Where did you meet Li Mei?

209
00:12:32,120 --> 00:12:33,360
Half a year ago.

210
00:12:34,880 --> 00:12:36,120
At Fengshan Villa.

211
00:12:37,520 --> 00:12:38,560
Fengshan Villa?

212
00:12:38,760 --> 00:12:39,600
Half a year ago,

213
00:12:40,240 --> 00:12:42,360
I was delivering a contract
to Le Tianyi.

214
00:12:50,600 --> 00:12:51,400
Mr. Jia?

215
00:12:52,920 --> 00:12:54,760
Hello, I'm Li Mei.

216
00:12:55,400 --> 00:12:56,760
I'm a friend of Mr. Zhang.

217
00:12:58,920 --> 00:12:59,920
Ms. Li, hello.

218
00:13:00,120 --> 00:13:01,120
A friend of Mr. Zhang?

219
00:13:01,120 --> 00:13:03,120
You look so elegant.

220
00:13:06,920 --> 00:13:08,320
What did you want to see me about?

221
00:13:08,440 --> 00:13:09,600
Well,

222
00:13:10,120 --> 00:13:12,600
is He Guifen your client?

223
00:13:14,280 --> 00:13:15,560
Technically,

224
00:13:15,680 --> 00:13:17,920
Guifen is Mr. Zhang's client.

225
00:13:18,120 --> 00:13:20,360
Ms. Li, you're interested?

226
00:13:24,120 --> 00:13:25,560
Let me buy you a drink.

227
00:13:27,920 --> 00:13:29,640
(I did get greedy back then.)

228
00:13:29,920 --> 00:13:31,360
(I figured if I could close)

229
00:13:31,360 --> 00:13:33,120
(He Guifen's contract with Ms. Li,)

230
00:13:33,200 --> 00:13:34,600
(maybe I'd get a bigger cut,)

231
00:13:34,600 --> 00:13:36,120
(so I brought her to meet He Guifen.)

232
00:13:37,080 --> 00:13:37,880
And you are?

233
00:13:40,080 --> 00:13:40,880
Guifen.

234
00:13:41,880 --> 00:13:42,680
Jia,

235
00:13:42,760 --> 00:13:44,440
you're right on time.

236
00:13:44,560 --> 00:13:45,720
Let's talk inside?

237
00:13:45,720 --> 00:13:46,400
Okay.

238
00:13:47,880 --> 00:13:48,680
Guifen.

239
00:13:50,400 --> 00:13:53,360
How come you've lost so much weight
after just a few days?

240
00:13:55,280 --> 00:13:56,760
My bad. Forgot to introduce.

241
00:13:56,760 --> 00:13:59,240
This is our money backer, Ms. Li.

242
00:13:59,280 --> 00:14:00,560
She's from the big city.

243
00:14:01,640 --> 00:14:03,840
Your monthly interest
always came on time,

244
00:14:04,080 --> 00:14:05,920
and that's thanks to Ms. Li.

245
00:14:06,120 --> 00:14:06,840
Ms. Li.

246
00:14:06,840 --> 00:14:08,360
- Ms. He, hello.
- I've heard so much about you.

247
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:09,800
Hello.

248
00:14:11,920 --> 00:14:13,800
This is your dividend from last quarter.

249
00:14:19,240 --> 00:14:20,040
How about it?

250
00:14:20,120 --> 00:14:21,600
Wasn't I right about investing

251
00:14:21,600 --> 00:14:22,560
in this project?

252
00:14:22,680 --> 00:14:23,480
Yes.

253
00:14:23,880 --> 00:14:24,960
Thank you, Ms. Li.

254
00:14:25,120 --> 00:14:26,200
No worries.

255
00:14:26,240 --> 00:14:27,120
Let me get you some water.

256
00:14:27,120 --> 00:14:27,720
I'll do it.

257
00:14:27,720 --> 00:14:29,000
Don't bother.

258
00:14:29,000 --> 00:14:30,760
Don't be so formal, Ms. He.

259
00:14:30,920 --> 00:14:33,360
We're getting rich together.

260
00:14:34,040 --> 00:14:35,120
Jia told me

261
00:14:35,120 --> 00:14:36,760
you've got a great eye for investment.

262
00:14:36,760 --> 00:14:37,400
Yes.

263
00:14:37,640 --> 00:14:38,920
So as soon as a good project came up,

264
00:14:38,920 --> 00:14:40,360
I came straight to you.

265
00:14:40,360 --> 00:14:41,080
Look.

266
00:14:42,200 --> 00:14:43,640
What good project is it this time?

267
00:14:44,280 --> 00:14:45,480
How much can I make?

268
00:14:45,480 --> 00:14:46,600
Listen,

269
00:14:46,760 --> 00:14:48,000
this project

270
00:14:48,280 --> 00:14:49,520
has a high return rate.

271
00:14:49,560 --> 00:14:51,040
Backed by a big group.

272
00:14:51,640 --> 00:14:52,880
Guaranteed profit.

273
00:14:53,800 --> 00:14:56,280
It's just that the threshold
is a bit high.

274
00:14:56,720 --> 00:14:59,440
Minimum investment
can't be under a million.

275
00:14:59,600 --> 00:15:01,840
Only twenty spots in the whole province.

276
00:15:01,840 --> 00:15:02,880
A million?

277
00:15:04,360 --> 00:15:05,160
I...

278
00:15:06,200 --> 00:15:07,040
Ms. He.

279
00:15:07,440 --> 00:15:08,320
No rush.

280
00:15:08,440 --> 00:15:10,480
Let me tell you, this project

281
00:15:10,640 --> 00:15:12,960
has an annual return of 80%.

282
00:15:13,120 --> 00:15:16,840
In a year, you get back 1.8 million.

283
00:15:17,360 --> 00:15:19,440
And it pays interest quarterly.

284
00:15:19,440 --> 00:15:19,920
That much?

285
00:15:19,920 --> 00:15:23,120
You get back two hundred thousand
every quarter.

286
00:15:23,440 --> 00:15:26,120
I... I wanna make that 1.8 million.

287
00:15:26,240 --> 00:15:28,880
But I only have five hundred thousand.

288
00:15:29,160 --> 00:15:29,840
Five hundred thousand?

289
00:15:29,840 --> 00:15:31,960
- Oh boy.
- I can't come up with a million.

290
00:15:32,040 --> 00:15:33,240
I only have five hundred thousand.

291
00:15:33,760 --> 00:15:34,560
Ms. He.

292
00:15:35,200 --> 00:15:36,520
I've got a suggestion.

293
00:15:36,520 --> 00:15:36,840
Go on.

294
00:15:36,840 --> 00:15:40,080
Your house is in a good location.

295
00:15:40,520 --> 00:15:42,480
Should be worth
over five hundred thousand.

296
00:15:43,440 --> 00:15:46,040
Get a mortgage on it from the bank.

297
00:15:47,120 --> 00:15:48,480
Then you'll have exactly a million.

298
00:15:49,160 --> 00:15:52,120
A year later, you get 1.8 million.

299
00:15:52,400 --> 00:15:53,640
After paying off the loan,

300
00:15:54,520 --> 00:15:56,760
you still net
seven or eight hundred thousand.

301
00:15:56,760 --> 00:15:57,440
I...

302
00:15:59,560 --> 00:16:00,440
Guifen,

303
00:16:00,720 --> 00:16:02,320
you gotta think it over carefully.

304
00:16:03,120 --> 00:16:04,240
I'd say

305
00:16:04,240 --> 00:16:05,880
this is practically

306
00:16:06,040 --> 00:16:07,320
a once-in-a-lifetime chance.

307
00:16:07,720 --> 00:16:10,000
If you invest in this project,

308
00:16:10,000 --> 00:16:10,880
a year from now,

309
00:16:11,280 --> 00:16:13,680
you'll be a millionaire.

310
00:16:15,160 --> 00:16:15,960
I...

311
00:16:16,800 --> 00:16:17,680
But... but I...

312
00:16:17,880 --> 00:16:18,960
Hey, Jia.

313
00:16:18,960 --> 00:16:20,440
Stop talking.

314
00:16:20,720 --> 00:16:22,640
Let Ms. He think it over.

315
00:16:23,080 --> 00:16:24,440
See, it's like this.

316
00:16:24,600 --> 00:16:26,560
I'd love to save you a spot.

317
00:16:27,000 --> 00:16:29,640
But too many people are fighting for it.

318
00:16:29,640 --> 00:16:31,440
If the spots get grabbed up,

319
00:16:31,440 --> 00:16:32,960
there's nothing I can do.

320
00:16:33,320 --> 00:16:34,920
Ms. He, take your time.

321
00:16:35,440 --> 00:16:36,320
No rush.

322
00:16:36,320 --> 00:16:37,000
I'm heading out.

323
00:16:37,000 --> 00:16:37,640
No rush.

324
00:16:37,640 --> 00:16:39,440
Think it over, Guifen.

325
00:16:41,360 --> 00:16:42,160
Bye.

326
00:16:44,400 --> 00:16:45,200
We're leaving.

327
00:16:46,960 --> 00:16:47,760
I agree!

328
00:16:49,880 --> 00:16:51,240
I'll go do the paperwork right now.

329
00:16:51,280 --> 00:16:52,080
I...

330
00:16:52,560 --> 00:16:53,880
I... I'll go get the deed.

331
00:16:57,080 --> 00:16:57,920
Verified.

332
00:16:58,080 --> 00:17:00,240
Jia Xibei did introduce Le Tianyi

333
00:17:00,240 --> 00:17:01,920
to some loan shark resources
and drinking buddies.

334
00:17:01,960 --> 00:17:02,960
Within Sun Group,

335
00:17:02,960 --> 00:17:03,920
Jia Xibei

336
00:17:03,920 --> 00:17:05,280
is pretty marginalized.

337
00:17:05,680 --> 00:17:07,040
His relationship with Le Tianyi

338
00:17:07,240 --> 00:17:08,520
was all about sucking up to him.

339
00:17:08,560 --> 00:17:10,560
Just to get a bigger cut.

340
00:17:14,240 --> 00:17:16,280
This is the sketch of Li Mei

341
00:17:16,280 --> 00:17:18,040
that Jia Xibei provided.

342
00:17:22,720 --> 00:17:25,360
Way too generic.

343
00:17:25,600 --> 00:17:26,880
There's something even weirder.

344
00:17:27,040 --> 00:17:27,960
Li Mei's account

345
00:17:27,960 --> 00:17:29,680
was stolen from a rural woman.

346
00:17:30,040 --> 00:17:31,760
All the funds went overseas.

347
00:17:31,760 --> 00:17:32,960
No trail left.

348
00:17:36,300 --> 00:17:40,600
(Executer?)

349
00:17:40,600 --> 00:17:41,720
Jia Xibei

350
00:17:41,960 --> 00:17:44,280
definitely knows more
about Zhang Xiaodong.

351
00:17:46,600 --> 00:17:47,400
Han Liang.

352
00:17:48,800 --> 00:17:49,960
Get everything out of him.

353
00:17:49,960 --> 00:17:50,600
Yes, sir!

354
00:17:54,000 --> 00:17:55,320
Didn't you wanna make up
for your crimes?

355
00:17:56,280 --> 00:17:58,480
Fine, here's your chance.

356
00:17:59,320 --> 00:18:00,960
Think hard about what you left out.

357
00:18:04,800 --> 00:18:06,720
My throat feels a bit scratchy.

358
00:18:08,320 --> 00:18:09,280
I don't want water.

359
00:18:10,160 --> 00:18:11,080
Then what do you want?

360
00:18:11,880 --> 00:18:12,960
Give me a cigarette.

361
00:18:12,960 --> 00:18:14,560
Jia Xibei! Are you insane?

362
00:18:14,560 --> 00:18:15,200
Come on.

363
00:18:15,200 --> 00:18:15,960
Sit down.

364
00:18:16,160 --> 00:18:17,440
Calm down.

365
00:18:19,640 --> 00:18:20,440
Talk or not?

366
00:18:20,760 --> 00:18:22,560
Throat hurts. Can't talk.

367
00:18:22,560 --> 00:18:23,560
You're really pushing it, huh?

368
00:18:23,560 --> 00:18:24,240
Wait.

369
00:18:24,920 --> 00:18:25,720
I'll talk.

370
00:18:27,520 --> 00:18:30,040
One time, Le Tianyi got wasted

371
00:18:30,280 --> 00:18:31,880
and was bragging to me.

372
00:18:32,240 --> 00:18:33,360
He said, "Jia Xiba..."

373
00:18:34,280 --> 00:18:34,920
My nickname.

374
00:18:35,720 --> 00:18:36,640
Xiba,

375
00:18:37,400 --> 00:18:40,520
I know a huge secret
about Zhang Xiaodong.

376
00:18:40,800 --> 00:18:41,920
When the time's right,

377
00:18:42,120 --> 00:18:44,040
if things go south, I'll expose it.

378
00:18:44,160 --> 00:18:45,320
You're keeping us in suspense?

379
00:18:45,320 --> 00:18:46,240
Just tell us!

380
00:18:47,000 --> 00:18:47,800
He said

381
00:18:48,360 --> 00:18:52,080
Zhang Xiaodong buried something shady

382
00:18:52,440 --> 00:18:54,160
at Fengshan Villa.

383
00:18:56,320 --> 00:18:57,360
(He once wove lies)

384
00:18:57,360 --> 00:19:00,240
(into the most beautiful "virtue")

385
00:19:00,600 --> 00:19:03,560
(and watered his family's bloodline
with the bones of young girls.)

386
00:19:04,160 --> 00:19:04,960
(Now,)

387
00:19:05,280 --> 00:19:06,720
(his rotting body)

388
00:19:07,400 --> 00:19:09,800
(will become fertilizer
for another field of flowers.)

389
00:19:19,800 --> 00:19:24,010
♪Sunset washes over the old wall♪

390
00:19:24,550 --> 00:19:28,540
♪Milk tea cools on the stone steps♪

391
00:19:28,910 --> 00:19:32,910
♪Sea wind tugs at your sleeve♪

392
00:19:33,390 --> 00:19:37,240
♪Unspoken words just flee and fade♪

393
00:19:46,240 --> 00:19:50,140
♪The marks on the desk
have faded yellow♪

394
00:19:50,140 --> 00:19:52,910
♪I turned around,
and a gunshot rang out♪

395
00:19:53,650 --> 00:19:57,260
♪No one can truly feel another's pain♪

396
00:19:57,260 --> 00:20:01,480
♪The wind is cold,
a fading shadow sways♪

397
00:20:01,480 --> 00:20:06,220
♪Tonight, I don't care
about the universe♪

398
00:20:06,220 --> 00:20:10,550
♪I only want to see this through
with you♪

399
00:20:11,260 --> 00:20:15,020
♪A bullet pierces the spring night♪

400
00:20:15,020 --> 00:20:19,240
♪You sink into the vast crowd♪

401
00:20:28,070 --> 00:20:32,290
♪Years later, when we meet again♪

402
00:20:32,290 --> 00:20:36,610
♪Don't mention this moonlit night♪

403
00:20:36,610 --> 00:20:40,380
♪The waves smooth
two lines of footprints♪

404
00:20:40,380 --> 00:20:43,290
♪Half a cup of sweetness
sinks into the sand♪

405
00:20:43,290 --> 00:20:48,080
♪Tonight, I don't care
about the universe♪

406
00:20:48,080 --> 00:20:52,730
♪I only want to see this through
with you♪

407
00:20:52,730 --> 00:20:55,050
♪Wind back to shore,
clouds back to hills♪

408
00:20:55,050 --> 00:20:57,110
♪We stop here in this night♪

409
00:20:57,110 --> 00:21:01,550
♪This is the past, the only,
the last look back♪

410
00:21:01,550 --> 00:21:07,530
♪One gunshot echoes through half a life♪

411
00:21:09,950 --> 00:21:15,780
♪One gunshot echoes through half a life♪

412
00:21:27,790 --> 00:21:34,190
♪One gunshot echoes through half a life♪

413
